        "id": "letter_body",
        "type": "text",
        "raw": "Dear Fr. Kurian,\n\nBrightLine Interiors has pleasure in submitting this estimate for the smart-classroom refresh discussed during your site visit on 5 April 2026. The figures cover supply of interactive display hardware and fixed seating for Lab B only; electrical point upgrades remain with your nominated contractor.\n\nPricing is valid for thirty days. We can align installation with the summer break window you indicated (first two weeks of May). Please reply with any quantity changes so we can revise before the board meeting.\n\nYours faithfully,\nBrightLine Interiors — Projects",
